From: Brady <brady@aioscilloscope.com>
Subject: rtc: rk808: bind the RK808's own RTC cell (6.12)
Copyright (C) 2026 Olympian LED, Inc.

The RK808 MFD registers an "rk808-rtc" cell, but the RTC driver's platform
id table did not list it, so an RK808 board had no rtc0. Add the missing id.

---
diff --git a/drivers/rtc/rtc-rk808.c b/drivers/rtc/rtc-rk808.c
--- a/drivers/rtc/rtc-rk808.c
+++ b/drivers/rtc/rtc-rk808.c
@@ -485,6 +485,7 @@
 
 static const struct platform_device_id rk8xx_rtc_id_table[] = {
 	{ "rk805-rtc", 0 },
+	{ "rk808-rtc", 0 },
 	{ "rk809-rtc", 0 },
 	{ "rk816-rtc", 0 },
 	{ "rk817-rtc", 0 },
